# Environment for openagents-gateway.service — install as
# /etc/openagents-gateway/gateway.env, mode 0600, owned by the service
# user.
#
# The gateway reads its whole configuration from --config
# /etc/openagents-gateway/gateway.json; this file exists for values that
# must not live in the config. There are none today: tenant keys live in
# the registry's keys.json, digests only, and backend endpoints are
# localhost URLs, not secrets. Keep this file so a future operator knob
# has a home that systemd already isolates.
